      "text": "805. 解方程组：\nа) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{x+y}{4}-\\frac{y}{3}=2,\\\\\\frac{x+y}{5}+x=15\\end{cases}$；\nб) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{x-y}{3}+\\frac{x}{5}=8,\\\\\\frac{x}{10}-\\frac{y}{32}=2\\end{cases}$.",
